,{"text":"னுரையே","tr":"ṉuraiyē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"னுரை","tr":"ṉurai"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"யே","tr":"yē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"},{"surface":"திறத்து","parts":[{"text":"திறத்து","lemma":"திறம்","gloss":"side/account"}],"gloss":"on account of"},{"surface":"அவலம்","parts":[{"text":"அவலம்","lemma":"அவலம்","gloss":"sorrow"}],"gloss":"sorrow"},{"surface":"கொள்ளல்","parts":[{"text":"கொள்ளல்","lemma":"கொள்","gloss":"have/take"}],"gloss":"do not have"},{"surface":"இனியே","parts":[{"text":"இனி","lemma":"இனி","gloss":"now/henceforth"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphatic"}],"gloss":"now indeed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வல்","parts":[{"text":"வல்","lemma":"வல்","gloss":"strong"}],"gloss":"strong"},{"surface":"வார்","parts":[{"text":"வார்","lemma":"வார்","gloss":"leather strap"}],"gloss":"leather strap"},{"surface":"கண்ணி","parts":[{"text":"கண்ணி","lemma":"கண்ணி","gloss":"wreath"}],"gloss":"wreath"},{"surface":"இளையர்","parts":[{"text":"இளையர்","lemma":"இளையர்","gloss":"young men"}],"gloss":"young men"},{"surface":"திளைப்ப","parts":[{"text":"திளைப்ப","lemma":"திளை","gloss":"enjoy/embrace"}],"gloss":"to enjoy"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நாகாஅல்","parts":[{"text":"நாகாஅல்","lemma":"நாகாஅல்","gloss":"do not laugh"}],"gloss":"do not laugh","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"என","parts":[{"text":"என","lemma":"என்","gloss":"say"}],"gloss":"saying"},{"surface":"வந்த","parts":[{"text":"வந்த","lemma":"வா","gloss":"come"}],"gloss":"that came"},{"surface":"மாறே","parts":[{"text":"மாறு","lemma":"மாறு","gloss":"because/since"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphatic"}],"gloss":"since"},{"surface":"எழாநெல்","parts":[{"text":"எழா","lemma":"எழா","gloss":"eḻā-reed"},{"text":"நெல்","lemma":"நெல்","gloss":"grain/paddy"}],"gloss":"eḻā-reed"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பைங்கழை","parts":[{"text":"பைங்கழை","lemma":"பைங்கழை","gloss":"green stem"}],"gloss":"green stem","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"பொதிகளைந்து","parts":[{"text":"பொதி","lemma":"பொதி","gloss":"sheath/cover"},{"text":"களைந்து","lemma":"களை","gloss":"having removed"}],"gloss":"having peeled off the sheath"},{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"like"}],"gloss":"like"},{"surface":"விளர்ப்பின்","parts":[{"text":"விளர்ப்பு","lemma":"விளர்ப்பு","gloss":"paleness"},{"text":"இன்","lemma":"இன்","gloss":"of/with"}],"gloss":"with paleness"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வளைஇல்","parts":[{"text":"வளை","lemma":"வளை","gloss":"bangle"},{"text":"இல்","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"without"}],"gloss":"without bangles"},{"surface":"வறுங்கை","parts":[{"text":"வறுமை","lemma":"வறுமை","gloss":"empty/bare"},{"text":"கை","lemma":"கை","gloss":"hand"}],"gloss":"bare hand"},{"surface":"ஓச்சி","parts":[{"text":"ஓச்சி","lemma":"ஓச்சு","gloss":"raise"}],"gloss":"having raised"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கிளையுள்","parts":[{"text":"கிளை","lemma":"கிளை","gloss":"relatives/kin"},{"text":"உள்","lemma":"உள்","gloss":"among/inside"}],"gloss":"among relatives"},{"surface":"ஒய்வலோ","parts":[{"text":"ஒய்வல்","lemma":"ஒய்","gloss":"go/be reduced"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"interrogative"}],"gloss":"shall I go?"},{"surface":"கூறு","parts":[{"text":"கூறு","lemma":"கூறு","gloss":"say"}],"gloss":"say"},{"surface":"நின்","parts":[{"text":"நின்","lemma":"நீ","gloss":"you"}],"gloss":"your"},{"surface":"உரையே","parts":[{"text":"உரை","lemma":"உரை","gloss":"word"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"emphatic"}],"gloss":"word"}]}],"literal":"On my account sorrow do not have now! / While strong-strapped wreath young men enjoy, / since you came saying 'do not laugh', / like peeling off the sheath of the green stem of the eḻā-reed, with paleness, / raising bare hands without bangles, / shall I go among relatives? Speak your word!","translation":"Do not grieve on my account anymore. While other young men wearing wreaths with strong leather straps enjoy their lives, since you have departed, leaving me with the command 'do not laugh', shall I raise my bare arms, stripped of bangles and pale like the inner stem of the green eḻā-reed when its sheath is peeled off, and go to live among my relatives? Speak your word!","modern":"இனி என் பொருட்டு வருத்தம் கொள்ளாதே. வலிமையான வார் கட்டிய மாலையை அணிந்த இளைஞர்கள் இன்புற்று வாழ, 'இனி சிரிக்காதே' என்று நீ இறந்துபோன காரணத்தால், உறை நீக்கப்பட்ட எழாநெல்லின் பசுமையான தண்டினைப் போன்ற வெளுத்த நிறமுடைய, வளையல்கள் இல்லாத என் வெற்றுக்கைகளை உயர்த்தி அழுதுகொண்டு, என் சுற்றத்தாரிடம் நான் செல்ல வேண்டுமா? உன் பதிலைச் சொல்வாயாக.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Puṟanāṉūṟu collection under the theme of Mutupālai, which depicts the tragic journey of a couple through the desert where one of them dies. Here, the wife addresses her dead husband who has perished on their path. She tells him not to worry about her anymore, even as she faces a bleak future. She compares her bare, bangle-less arms, which have turned pale with grief, to the pale inner stem of a green eḻā-reed after its outer sheath is peeled away. Raising these empty arms, she asks him if she should return to her relatives as a widow, begging him to speak one last word of guidance.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.19,0.64],[0.7,1.0],[1.0,1.2],[1.2,1.5],[1.5,2.14],[2.35,2.56],[2.56,3.2],[3.2,3.54],[3.6,4.8],[4.8,5.1],[5.1,5.4],[5.4,5.97],[6.2,6.5],[6.5,7.6],[7.6,7.9],[7.9,8.02],[8.27,9.0],[9.0,10.5],[10.5,10.7],[10.81,11.5],[11.5,12.6],[12.66,12.84],[12.9,13.5],[13.5,13.6]],"female":[[0.22,0.73],[0.8,1.2],[1.2,1.5],[1.5,1.7],[1.7,2.82],[2.82,2.98],[2.98,3.14],[3.14,3.14],[3.14,3.3],[3.3,5.5],[5.5,5.8],[5.8,6.1],[6.1,6.55],[6.55,7.0],[7.15,8.5],[8.5,8.7],[8.77,8.9],[8.9,10.1],[10.1,10.3],[10.3,10.98],[10.98,12.0],[12.1,12.4],[12.5,13.1],[13.1,13.2]]}}